due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-24T18:16:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T08:33:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible: v4.8.dev.custom_build [ca871ccc9]\n\nThe versions prior to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94096 should also be affected, but can't test currently.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (ca871cc) - EndeavourOS `#1` SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Mon, 14 Sep 2026 22:41:30 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors (1920x1080 @ 165.00 Hz, 1920x1080 @ 60.01 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (nvidia; 615.71.09) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9300H CPU @ 2.40GHz (8 threads) - 15.49 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nSimilar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042, but you need to inspect the remove object manually. Also the editor does recognize the user input.\n\nIn `RemoteDebugger::debug` inside the `while` loop it enters `RemoteDebugger::debug` again from the `getter`, resuming the game only exits the inner debug loop, so now it is stuck in the outer `while` loop.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18b40be2-58da-405e-88a3-b34d36c7dc48\n\nIf you resume and pause enough times you can exit all `while` loops.\n\n<img width=\"1229\" height=\"298\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d553b87b-cd0c-4198-88c1-3517a618238f\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe same as in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123042, but you need to select the Node after the error in the remote tree.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nCreate a simple scene with a single Control node, and add the following script to the node:\n```GDScript\nextends Control\n\nconst OUT_OF_BOUNDS_INDEX = 10\nvar test_array: Array[int] = []\n\nvar property: int = 0:\n\tget:\n\t\treturn test_array[OUT_OF_BOUNDS_INDEX]\n\nfunc  _ready() -> void:\n\tvar test : int = property\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123807/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}